  "title": "Lua: Check size of lua_Integer",
  "description": "Check and store the size of lua_Integer. (There are some defines that\nluaconf.h has for maximum number storable in an integer, but they are\ndifferent in different versions. This always exists.)\nStore it in a define.\n\nNote that the lua_Integer size can be smaller, or larger, than the\nsize of an int on a platform. On Lua 5.3 and later, it does default\nto being 64-bit.",
